+# Proactive persona sends (card line-proactive-persona): a persona
+# INITIATES contact — a member DM or an in-group @mention — by posting
+# /send with intent='proactive'. The backend tool layer keeps this
+# owner-tier (a secondary speaker can't declare it) and the relay
+# enforces its own policy on top: the sending instance must sit in
+# LINE_PROACTIVE_ALLOW, the (instance, chat) pair and each engaged
+# member debounce for LINE_PROACTIVE_DEBOUNCE_S, and the (instance,
+# chat) day cap bounds the room's proactive volume. State write-through
